OL,3,GNEWSAFuture of Chester's landmark
OL,4,AGrosvenor hotel 'secured'
OL,5,
OL,6,FChester's landmark Grosvenor hotel has
OL,7,Fhad its long-term future secured with
OL,8,Fthe appointment of a new operator, the
OL,9,Fowners said.
OL,11,FCurrent operator Bespoke Hotels
OL,12,Fannounced earlier this year that the
OL,13,Ffive-star establishment would be
OL,14,Fclosing on 30 September.
OL,16,FNow Grosvenor, which owns the freehold
OL,17,Fof the Grade II listed property, has
OL,18,Fannounced that the Martin Property
OL,19,FGroup would be taking over as operators
OL,20,Fand would be overseeing a "major
OL,21,Frefurbishment".
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,407,400,260,160,0,100
