OL,3,GNEWSAFuture of Chester's landmark
OL,4,AGrosvenor hotel 'secured'
OL,5,
OL,6,FNicholas Dobbs from Grosvenor said:
OL,7,F"Our ambition is to reopen as The
OL,8,FChester Grosvenor, creating new
OL,9,Femployment, strengthening Chester's
OL,10,Ftourism and hospitality economy and
OL,11,Fdelivering long-term value for the
OL,12,Fcity."
